      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|><|channel>thought\n<channel|><|channel>thought\n<channel|><|channel>thought\n<channel|>those make sense, but they feel a bit... soft? like, they're more about how you process info rather than how you actually act as a person in a community. don't you think something like individual responsibility or respecting tradition is just as important for a stable society? or are those seen as outdated in this context?",
